        "original_id": "46150724-2731-51dc-8890-eaf5dc2d23aa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Atlanta, Georgia, USA, Vine City\n- Organizations: Georgia World Congress Center Authority, State of Georgia\n- Products: Georgia World Congress Center, Georgia Dome, Centennial Olympic Park, Mercedes-Benz Stadium\n\nFacts:\n- The Georgia World Congress Center is a convention center in Atlanta, Georgia, USA.\n- The Georgia Dome was located in Atlanta, Georgia, between downtown on the east and Vine City on the west.\n- The Georgia Dome was owned and operated by the State of Georgia as part of the Georgia World Congress Center Authority.\n- The Georgia World Congress Center Authority later developed the Georgia Dome, Centennial Olympic Park, and Mercedes-Benz Stadium.\n- Mercedes-Benz Stadium replaced the Georgia Dome.\n- The Georgia Dome is a recently retired domed stadium in the southeastern United States and is currently under demolition.",
